      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CORE · Job runner\n**Purpose**: run one claimed job in its handler workflow (job_types.workflow_id) and record the outcome.\n**Input**: a claim_jobs row (id, type, workflow_id, payload, material_id, package_id, variant_id, brand_id, attempts).\n**Output**: none.\n**Side effects**: job_done / job_failed (error codes: budget_exceeded -> blocked, fatal -> dead, other -> retry with backoff); then the fast path: dispatcher / notify / publisher when there is work.\n**TZ**: architecture 4.2, 8.1.",
        "height": 192,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
